<div class="text-center">
    <h1 class="display-4">Welcome To SeniorLearn Australia</h1>
	<p>Since its inception in 1984, SeniorLearn has been a pioneer in fostering lifelong learning 
		among seniors. It is an organisation dedicated to providing educational opportunities 
		to seniors, with members offering a range of lessons designed to enhance learning and engagement 
		within the senior community. Their mission is to foster a lifelong learning environment that 
		supports senior citizens in keeping their minds active and engaged.
	</p>
